==Battleground==
*2 [[Samurai Doggy|Samurai Doggies]] spawn after 41.13 seconds<sup>1,234f</sup>, delay 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
*2 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Gory Groom]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**8 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is made almost entirely of [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] foes, with the exception of St. Pigge the 2nd. They can be dealt with easily, so you should know what this means: mono-teams. Bust out your [[XP Stage]] team and copy it onto another team. Then, do some minor modifications to account for the [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] if necessary. Remember that Samurai Doggy is both Dark and Red.

